 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูลถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py",
 "strings": {
  "I should have been more careful...": "",
  "I heard about what happened at Ikedaya.": "",
  "Lot of bloodshed, I imagine.": "",
  "Anyhow, I'm glad you're alright, Hajime-san.": "",
  "*sigh* I can't get over what happened at Ikedaya.": "",
  "I mean, the same thing could easily happen to us at any time.": "",
  "I've gotta stay on my toes...": "",
  "Oh, but if anything were to go down, do you think I can count on you to protect us, Hajime-san?": "",
  "You do owe us a lot of money, after all.": "",
  "So he's connected to a British arms dealer...": "",
  "<i>And</i> he's an apprentice to Katsu Rintaro?": "",
  "Who'd've thought this imposter was such a big shot?": "",
  "This other Sakamoto Ryoma...": "",
  "I'll look into him on my end as well.": "",
  "You're headed for the Satsuma Consulate, aren't you?": "",
  "This Sakamoto Ryoma imposter...": "",
  "I wonder why he's using your name.": "",
  "Could there be some meaning behind it? Or maybe...": "",
  "If yer that curious, why not take a look?": "",
  "The chief's room's all the way in the back.": "",
  "Heh. No chief, right?": "",
  "I told you so.": "",
  "Just give it up for today.": "",
  "Ya wanna meet the chief that badly?": "",
  "You'll meet 'im soon...": "",
  "if ya stay on and manage not to screw up.": "",
  "Are Soji and Takeda playin' Mahjong again?": "",
  "Gotta say, I feel sorry for the troopers who gotta play with 'em.": "",
  "Can't imagine that's much fun.": "",
  "Awfully quiet tonight.": "",
  "The raid on Ikedaya must've worked out...": "",
  "There's usually something goin' on around this time.": "",
  "Those loyalist dogs must be holdin' their breaths tonight.": "",
  "I fell behind at Ikedaya...": "",
  "I wasn't even hurt all that bad. I should've done better.": "",
  "Workin' hard, eh?": "",
  "See you managed to come back alive.": "",
  "Ya wear the captain's garb well.": "",
  "Ah, Hajime-san.": "",
  "I heard about Ikedaya...": "",
  "It must have been rough.": "",
  "Please don't do anything rash.": "",
  "Both Okami-san and I are sincerely worried about you.": "",
  "That rampage at Ikedaya...": "",
  "Rumors are flying all over town now.": "",
  "They're saying the Mibu wolves are as reckless as we all expected.": "",
  "But I believe you're not doing it because you truly want to, Hajime-san.": "",
  "I've only seen no-names since Ikedaya.": "",
  "It's been boring, not gonna lie.": "",
  "We need something... big. Right, Heisuke?": "",
  "Safe to say Ikedaya wiped out a lot of major players.": "",
  "That or they're in hiding.": "",
  "What, like they're afraid of us now?": "",
  "Heh. I'll take it.": "",
  "All that matters is that we're the strongest.": "",
  "Hey, Saito. What're you up to?": "",
  "Out there making yourself look good, as usual?": "",
  "You always look like you're busy, Saito-san. Unlike us.": "",
  "Hah, maybe you're on a special mission.": "",
  "Were you able to see the chief?": "",
  "What? You been tryna see the chief?": "",
  "Ya don't meet with the chief, y'know—he meets with you.": "",
  "I told him as much.": "",
  "Why're ya here at the barracks? On standby too, are ya?": "",
  "Plus, I saw Sanosuke, Todo, and Nagakura around.": "",
  "Nothing's been happening since that incident at Ikedaya.": "",
  "Guess the captains are either on standby or busy trainin' their men.": "",
  "It's good that you're up early.": "",
  "Have a good day at work.": "",
  "Hajime-san, it's great that work is keeping you busy and all...": "",
  "But you ought to make some time for Oryo-chan, too.": "",
  "She's been looking a little lonely these days.": "",
  "Oh, Hajime-san, you're back already?": "",
  "Then, you should get plenty of rest.": "",
  "You've been awfully busy everyday, after all.": "",
  "Such a nice day...": "",
  "You were looking for someone the other day. Did anything happen with that?": "",
  "The sooner you find them, the sooner you can quit the Shinsengumi...": "",
  "To settle things 'tween Satsuma and Choshu...": "",
  "This woulda been the perfect time.": "",
  "Well, with things as they are...": "",
  "Might be better to just stick it out for today, eh?": "",
  "Heh, sure.": "",
  "This guy seriously tryin' to hit a bar right now?": "",
  "Yeah, who knows...": "",
  "I've just about given up.": "",
  "Well, when we're dragged around town by this drunk...": "",
  "I didn't think you knew him too, Saigo-san.": "",
  "Hmph. Chance encounter at a bathhouse.": "",
  "Hm? Bathhouse? Then, you...": "",
  "Yep. Bathkeeper of Sai.": "",
  "Who else? I went over there to dig up some dirt on ya.": "",
  "Fate sure is a strange thing.": "",
  "Heh, damn right.": "",
  "Still, to be here with Saigo Kichinosuke of Satsuma...": "",
  "Can't say I'd want too many catching wind of this.": "",
  "Hmph. Let 'em.": "",
  "Ya figure out where to go, or what?": "",
  "What's up with this guy?": "",
  "He's even stronger than before.": "",
  "No kidding. I'm supposed to be a master of Shinto Munen, too...": "",
  "Even if it was bare-handed, it's kinda depressing knowing he took us both down.": "",
  "You must really love dogs, Saigo-san.": "",
  "What, that a problem?": "",
  "Oh, no, I think it's great. It's unexpected.": "",
  "Honestly, I figured you the type to kick rather than pet.": "",
  "What're you sayin'?": "",
  "No way in hell I'd hurt a dog like that.": "",
  "Haha, well, my apologies, then.": "",
  "Yeah, dogs rule, man.": "",
  "Take 'em out huntin', and they'll corner their prey like nobody's business.": "",
  "They're way more capable than most people, and they're cute, too.": "",
  "Hmm, hunting, huh?": "",
  "Huh? We're still going?": "",
  "Ya seriously ain't had enough?": "",
  "Haha, you tell him...": "",
  "How much are we going to have to drink?": "",
  "Wait, are you serious?": "",
  "Uh, how about we call it quits here?": "",
  "Never learn, do ya?": "",
  "Hahaha, guess not...": "",
  "I never thought I'd see Hajime-san so roughed up...": "",
  "I hope he's alright.": "",
  "Oh, even Oryo-chan's all down.": "",
  "Oh, oh, Hajime-san. Where're you headed off to now?": "",
  "Haven't you had enough to drink?": "",
  "I think it's best you turn in.": "",
  "Oh no, Hajime-san, you're even more drunk than when you went out...": "",
  "I hope you didn't cause trouble for your friends.": "",
  "I'm sorry to bother you.": "",
  "Are you good friends with Hajime-san?": "",
  "Uh, well... Yeah, I guess we do get along.": "",
  "We haven't known each other for long, but we're square.": "",
  "Ah, I see.": "",
  "Well, I'm glad.": "",
  "He's always drinking alone, that signature scowl on his face...": "",
  "I didn't think he had any friends.": "",
  "Haha...": "",
  "Well, I guess that can happen if ya drink alone.": "",
  "It's true.": "",
  "You two sure look strong.": "",
  "I wish Hajime-san had the same sort of spirit like you two.": "",
  "Oh, welcome.": "",
  "Stop on by anytime.": "",
  "Hajime-san, please don't drink so much, or you'll cause trouble.": "",
  "People'll get fed up with you.": "",
  "I hope Hajime-san's okay...": "",
  "Drinking all that much can't be good for you.": "",
  "That's the first time I've seen him lose himself like that.": "",
  "He even brought up his brother.": "",
  "He must've meant a lot to him...": "",
  "I don't know what I'll do if this keeps up.": "",
  "I hope he calms down soon.": "",
  "I'm worried about him...": "",
  "Hajime-san, you're going out?": "",
  "But you're so drunk...": "",
  "Oh, Hajime-san...": "",
  "Ah, welcome back...": "",
  "Dammit... So the Shinsengumi think I'm a pawn, huh?": "",
  "No way, I'm the friggin' rook! And I'm callin' checkmate!": "",
  "What happened to the Shinsengumi being the strongest?": "",
  "You gotta be kidding me, dammit...": "",
  "That damn Okita...": "",
  "I'm gonna crush that guy for sure.": "",
  "Hey, care to join us for a drink? Uh... I'm gonna guess you'd rather not.": "",
  "Fuck that!": "",
  "Not while Saito's here!": "",
  "Goddamn newbie acts like he owns the place!": "",
  "Haha... Just leave him to me, Saito-san.": "",
  "Phew. Think I ate too much.": "",
  "If I work like this, I'll just make myself sick... Better sleep it off.": "",
  "The Shieikan faction's all in an uproar.": "",
  "Heh, idiots. To hell with them.": "",
  "Hey, Saito.": "",
  "So Inoue went and got himself killed, huh?": "",
  "Well, who cares about that old timer?": "",
  "The Shieikan guys are in a big enough mess as it is.": "",
  "Better you just don't get involved.": "",
  "Maybe forget about 'em, and come pay my room a visit, eh?": "",
  "I'm sure we could have some fun... Whaddya say?": "",
  "Saito-kun!": "",
  "They found Ryoma, Gen-san's killer.": "",
  "He'll be at Teradaya in Fushimi.": "",
  "Ito and Takeda are leading Fifth Division there now.": "",
  "Saito-kun, and Soji.": "",
  "You'll be going too, I hope? I'm counting on you.": "",
  "Ah, we're missing some of those, too.": "",
  "I'll have to ask Oryo-chan to get some.": "",
  "Was there anything else that I needed?": "",
  "Oh, Hajime-san, did you need something?": "",
  "We suddenly got a big group of guests coming to stay, so it's been a bit busy.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but we'll be running around for a while.": "",
  "All rooms are occupied, including the one next to yours.": "",
  "It might get a little noisy at night, but please just bear with us.": "",
  "Then again, you might not be the type to care.": "",
  "How are things with Oyro-chan lately?": "",
  "I'm going to have Oryo-chan working around the clock.": "",
  "She might not get much time to relax...": "",
  "Still, try and say hi to her every now and then.": "",
  "For now, y'oughta head to the barracks.": "",
  "What, yer still here?": "",
  "Looks like the First Division's movin' out.": "",
  "What's Soji even up to?": "",
  "Never thought Gen-san, of all people, would go dyin' on us like that.": "",
  "Don't know who coulda done it, but I guess that means an even stronger enemy's moved in.": "",
  "Gen-san... Yeah, he wasn't like Tani and Suzuki, the two Izo killed.": "",
  "He was even more skilled than the chief...": "",
  "And now he's gone... Dammit, what the hell's gonna happen to us!?": "",
  "Gen-san... I'll avenge you, I swear.": "",
  "Let's hurry over to Teradaya.": "",
  "Hajime-chan...": "",
  "Don't know who it is, but they've gotta be pretty sharp.": "",
  "You let your guard down, you're done for. Got that?": "",
  "Ito and the others are already headin' out.": "",
  "We gotta hurry, Hajime-chan.": "",
  "To think that Ito'd be the one makin' moves this time around...": "",
  "Wonder what's eatin' him?": "",
  "Maybe someone complained.": "",
  "Either that, or it's gotten to the point where he's gotta step up 'n' be a good example...": "",
  "Well, not on my watch.": "",
  "Ito and Takeda...": "",
  "They might be at Teradaya already.": "",
  "No matter what, Sakamoto Ryoma's mine...": "",
  "Teradaya...": "",
  "Place is pretty big.": "",
  "Perfect for goin' off the rails. Heh.": "",
  "And we're goin' up against guys who could take down Gen-san?": "",
  "Heads are gonna roll.": "",
  "Those bastards won't know what hit 'em.": "",
  "C'mon, let's hurry.": "",
  "Dammit, I lost ya.": "",
  "Sorry, I'm a little busy right now...": "",
  "I'll see you later.": "",
  "See you soon.": "",
  "They're droppin' like flies...": "",
  "What the hell's going on!? Dammit!": "",
  "You go see Yamazaki yet?": "",
  "He's still probably lying there at the warehouse...": "",
  "Maybe this is it for this place.": "",
  "We've already lost so many.": "",
  "Can't unleash hell without hellfire.": "",
  "Feels like our shot at being the strongest is slipping away.": "",
  "Tch, looks like the Shinsengumi's on its last legs.": "",
  "We've got captains getting killed off left and right...": "",
  "And now we got deserters...": "",
  "You go there, and well...": "",
  "As usual, I can't get a bead on you.": "",
  "Yamazaki was stabbed right there inside the barracks...": "",
  "Not too hard to piece it together...": "",
  "The culprit's gotta be one of the captains.": ""
 }
}